@startuml
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> READY : reserve success
PENDING --> FAILED : definite insufficient stock
PENDING --> RECOVERY : uncertain reserve
READY --> PROCESSING : record payment
READY --> RECOVERY : release intent
PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : stock committed + outbox
PROCESSING --> RECOVERY : uncertain commit
RECOVERY --> READY : reconcile reserve
RECOVERY --> FAILED : definite reserve failure
RECOVERY --> COMPLETED : reconcile commit
RECOVERY --> CANCELLED : reconcile release
@enduml
